{
  "sn41.10:0.1": "Linked Discourses 41.10 ",
  "sn41.10:0.2": "1. With Citta ",
  "sn41.10:0.3": "Seeing the Sick ",
  "sn41.10:1.1": "Now at that time the householder Citta was sick, suffering, gravely ill. ",
  "sn41.10:1.2": "Then several deities of the parks, forests, trees, and those who haunt the herbs, grass, and big trees came together and said to Citta, ",
  "sn41.10:1.3": "“Householder, make a wish to become a wheel-turning monarch in the future!” ",
  "sn41.10:2.1": "When they said this, Citta said to them, ",
  "sn41.10:2.2": "“That too is impermanent! That too will pass! That too will be left behind!” ",
  "sn41.10:2.3": "When he said this, his friends and colleagues, relatives and kin said, ",
  "sn41.10:2.4": "“Be mindful, master! Don’t babble.” ",
  "sn41.10:2.5": "“What have I said that makes you say that?” ",
  "sn41.10:2.6": "",
  "sn41.10:2.7": "“It’s because you said: ",
  "sn41.10:2.8": "‘That too is impermanent! That too will pass! That too will be left behind!’” ",
  "sn41.10:2.9": "“Oh, well, that’s because the deities of the parks, forests, trees, and those who haunt the herbs, grass, and big trees said to me: ",
  "sn41.10:2.10": "‘Householder, make a wish to become a wheel-turning monarch in the future!’ ",
  "sn41.10:2.11": "So I said to them: ",
  "sn41.10:2.12": "‘That too is impermanent! That too will pass! That too will be left behind!’” ",
  "sn41.10:2.13": "“But what reason do they see for saying that to you?” ",
  "sn41.10:2.14"